# TypeChain files
typechain/
typechain-types/

# solidity-coverage files
coverage/
coverage.json

# Hardhat Ignition deployments. Local-chain records are ephemeral and are
# regenerated by dev.sh on every restart, so they stay out of the repo.
# chain-80002 (Polygon Amoy) is the exception: the paper cites that address, so
# the deployment record and its build-info are tracked, which is what lets a
# reader check the deployed bytecode against the compiled artifact.
ignition/deployments/*
!ignition/deployments/chain-80002/
# The blanket `artifacts/` rule above would otherwise swallow the compiled
# artifact inside that record, which is the half of the comparison the reader
# needs.
!ignition/deployments/chain-80002/artifacts/

